   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 multi-reference to video - TURBO\n\n`ref_multi_to_video_minimax_h3.json` plus lightx2v's Ref2V turbo distill\nLoRA (`minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`,\nstrength 1.0) loaded with the plain core `LoraLoaderModelOnly` node -\nno custom nodes. Wiring follows lightx2v's official example:\n`MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` (video 12 / audio 3, ComfyUI 0.31+ core) sits on\nthe guider branch only, so `BasicScheduler` still emits unshifted\nsigmas; sampler is `euler`/`simple`. The distill targets 4 steps; this\ngraph ships 8 (the community sharpness comfort zone is 6-8). Loaders,\nplaceholders, and submit-time pruning are identical to the 20-step\ngraph - to run manually in ComfyUI, delete the loaders you aren't\nusing.\n"
   ],
